{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Lin_thread.Make</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"qcheck-lin","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Lin_thread","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Make","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Parameters","href":"#parameters","children":[]},{"title":"Signature","href":"#signature","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Functor to build a module for concurrent testing</p>","content":"<h2 id=\"parameters\"><a href=\"#parameters\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Parameters</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec parameter anchored\" id=\"argument-1-Spec\"><a href=\"#argument-1-Spec\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> </span><span><a href=\"argument-1-Spec/index.html\">Spec</a></span><span> : <a href=\"../../Lin/module-type-Spec/index.html\">Lin.Spec</a></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"signature\"><a href=\"#signature\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Signature</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-lin_test\"><a href=\"#val-lin_test\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> lin_test : <span><span class=\"label\">count</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">QCheck</span>.Test.t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>lin_test ~count:c ~name:n</code> builds a concurrent test with the name <code>n</code> that iterates <code>c</code> times. The test fails if one of the generated programs is not sequentially consistent. In that case it fails, and prints a reduced counter example.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-neg_lin_test\"><a href=\"#val-neg_lin_test\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> neg_lin_test : <span><span class=\"label\">count</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">QCheck</span>.Test.t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>neg_lin_test ~count:c ~name:n</code> builds a negative concurrent test with the name <code>n</code> that iterates <code>c</code> times. The test fails if no counter example is found, and succeeds if a counter example is indeed found, and prints it afterwards.</p></div></div>"}